{{Quote|Imperial troops have entered the base! Imperial troops have ent&mdash;|A rebel soldier reporting Imperial forces entering Echo Base|<ref name="Episode V">{{Film|V}}</ref>}}
A [[human]] '''member''' of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]]<ref name="Invasion of Echo Base" /> served as a [[controller]]<ref name="Junior">[[Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back (paperback novel)|''Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back'' junior novelization]]</ref> for the Rebellion during their [[time]] at [[Echo Base]] on the [[planet]] [[Hoth]]. During the [[Battle of Hoth]], the [[Galactic Empire]] led by [[Dark Lord of the Sith]] [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] infiltrated the base. The rebel reported over a loudspeaker that Imperial [[snowtrooper]]s had infiltrated into the base.<ref name="Invasion of Echo Base" />

